SUMMARY:Discovery Drop-In & Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday from September 10 to November 19\n10 a.m.-noon \nJoin us for story time and self-guided activities in the Charlotte Brody Discovery Garden. Story times will begin at 10:30 and 11:30 a.m. each Thursday morning in the Story Circle in the Discovery Garden. Activities for caregivers to enjoy with their youngsters will be available on the picnic tables in the same garden area. \nFee: Free; parking fees apply. No registration required.
